  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Food &amp; Agriculture Organisation (FAO)  for implementation of Voluntary Guidelines on Land Tenure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved governance of tenure land, fisheries and forests contributing to the eradication of hunger and poverty, to sustainable development and to the sustainable use of the environment.  Progress made for the principles outlined in the Voluntary Guidelines on Land Tenure to be mainstreamed among key institutions dealing with the tenure of land, fisheries and forests.</narrative>
  </description>
